Id: dns002w
Severity: WARN
Category: network
Check: check_dns
Fix: Keep the three resolvers that should answer, in order.
References: resolv.conf(5)

/etc/resolv.conf names more than three servers, but the resolver only
uses the first three; the rest are never asked. The usual cause is
years of DHCP and hand edits piling up, and the fourth entry is often
the one the administrator believes is in force.
